Attribution

This project is derived from and built upon the original open-source work:

  onn-simulation (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Feng Zijia)
  https://github.com/feng-spinning/onn-simulation

The optical model re-implements the diffractive deep neural network described in:

  Lin, X., Rivenson, Y., Yardimci, N. T., Veli, M., Luo, Y., Jarrahi, M.,
  & Ozcan, A. "All-optical machine learning using diffractive deep neural
  networks." Science 361, 1004-1008 (2018).

The original copyright and permission notice are retained here as required
by the MIT License. Modifications and the present arrangement of the code
are the work of the current author.
